__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Secrets. Never relax these.
.env
*.key
credentials*

# NOT ignored, deliberately: state/ledger.json, state/fills.jsonl and the
# briefs, plans, news and reports under state/.
#
# Every Routine firing gets a fresh container and a fresh clone, and
# tools/state.load() silently recreates an EMPTY ledger when the file is
# absent. Ignoring these meant risk_state reset to NORMAL overnight (a halt
# un-tripping itself), peak_equity and week_start_equity resetting to 300 (so
# the -20% lock and -8% week stop could not fire), and fills.jsonl starting
# empty every day (so measured expectancy — the Phase 2 exit criterion — was
# permanently 0 closed trades).
#
# The repository is the thread. That only holds if the thread is committed.
